[/list][size=4][b]Install[/b][/size]
Install with Vortex or MO2; manual installs are not supported. The installer checks your setup first and offers CBBE or 3BBB breast physics.
[b]3BBB tip:[/b] build the "(Anatomy 3BBB)" torso sets, not Servitron's own: those are CBBE and don't jiggle on a 3BBB preset.
Needs: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/32801]Servitron[/url] and its [i]Servitron - BodySlide Files[/i], [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/93993]Servitron Physics Fix[/url] (CBBE option only: the 3BBB option includes its skeleton), [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/31304]AAF[/url], [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109435]Anatomy[/url] 1.2.5 and the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/109434]Anatomy Engine[/url] 1.2.14, and BodySlide.

